[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 3003.349, "timestamp": "00:50:03", "text": "让我喝杯茶。 我带了我爸爸"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3005.829, "timestamp": "00:50:05", "text": "给我的东西，就像热的……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3009.03, "timestamp": "00:50:09", "text": "呃，这叫什么？ 我把花草茶装在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3014.15, "timestamp": "00:50:14", "text": "保温瓶里，这样晚上就可以喝了。"}]